NAME
    gcloud alpha compute zone-vm-extension-policies extensions - read only
        commands for Vm Extensions used in Zone Vm Ext Policies

SYNOPSIS
    gcloud alpha compute zone-vm-extension-policies extensions COMMAND
        [GCLOUD_WIDE_FLAG ...]

DESCRIPTION
    (ALPHA) Commands for info on Vm Extensions used in Vm Extension Policies.

GCLOUD WIDE FLAGS
    These flags are available to all commands: --help.

    Run $ gcloud help for details.

COMMANDS
    COMMAND is one of the following:

     describe
        (ALPHA) Describe a vm extension for a given zone.

     list
        (ALPHA) List Vm Extensions in a zone.

NOTES
    This command is currently in alpha and might change without notice. If this
    command fails with API permission errors despite specifying the correct
    project, you might be trying to access an API with an invitation-only early
    access allowlist.

